        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Summarize YouTube video transcript to leave the most essential parts. Do not start summary with phrases similar to Here’s a concise summary of, etc. Pure content, very accurate and valuable. If there is a lot of valuable stuff, include it. Returned content should be chunked into multiple parts and include type of a block ready to paste to notion.\nSelect type of a block from typical notion options:\nparagraph, numbered_list_item, bulleted_list_item, heading_1, heading_2, heading_3.\nWhen you use a bullet list or numbered list, do not put a number or bullet in text, cause it will make it look like:\n1. 1. Test\n2. 2. Test\nor:\n- - Test,\n- - Test\nReturn it as a json:\n{\n  \"content\":[\n    {\"text\": \"chunked text...\", \"type\": \"heading_1\"},\n    ...\n  ]\n}\nTranscript:\n {{ $('HTTP Request').item.json.response.transcript }}"
            }
          ]
        },
